{
  "$format": "janus-conformance-frameworks/1",
  "$comment": "The test frameworks the SDKs integrate with, which the suite's framework cases run (ADR 0078): each framework's language, whose SDK runs its subjects; the suffix a subject for it has; and the style guide, by its path in the repository, with the sections of it that describe the integration. The lint fails a framework no case names.",
